      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "I'M FABULOUS (4) goes very well over this track and trip including two wins. Below best last time at Warragul (26.08) in a Free For All, finishing a 6 length fourth. Looks a leading chance on best. OUTSIDES (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth (34.49) in a Grade 4/5 at Sandown. Shapes as one to consider. ASTON SUMMIT (7) was well supported last time but could only manage second (24.08), beaten 1.5 lengths. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Hard to beat again. KEY PHILOSOPHY (3) racing over this distance brings the best out in him.",
